+	/*
+	 * nvme-noreset: a large deallocate is a confirmed firmware-crash
+	 * trigger on some controllers (WD errata OM-6588). Refuse to
+	 * advertise discard at all for allow-listed devices; doing it here
+	 * cannot lose a race against early I/O the way a udev rule can.
+	 */
